		"notes": "Every product id devicePEQ assigns to its \"SchemeNo11\" group, under each vendor id of the vendor block. devicePEQ doesn't record which vendor id goes with which product id, so most of these pairs don't exist. Replace with device profiles as devices are identified. Reported quirk, not corrected (D39): devicePEQ measured an EPZ TP13 placing bands about 2.25% below the frequency sent, with Q coming out lower toward high frequencies, and applies both to every SchemeNo11 device. Vendor apps send and show frequencies as they are, and so does this profile."
